# Built XCFramework binaries — produced by Scripts/build-xcframework.sh.
# Keep the framework metadata (Info.plist, Headers/, Modules/) tracked so
# the XCFramework structure is reviewable in PRs, but the static-archive
# binaries are ~70–140 MB each and should be rebuilt locally;
# distribute via GitHub Releases when shipping.
Frameworks/SyniRuntime.xcframework/*/SyniRuntime.framework/SyniRuntime